OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens if all the lights go
OL,4,Aout? This is the plan for a 'Black Sky'
OL,5,Aevent
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was a Saturday night in early
OL,8,FDecember when Roger Kemp realised
OL,9,Fsomething was very wrong.
OL,11,F"I was halfway through a Scandi crime
OL,12,Fdrama when everything went off," the
OL,13,Fprofessor at Lancaster University told
OL,14,Fthe BBC. "Streetlights were off. The
OL,15,Fsodium glow that we can see over the
OL,16,Fhorizon from Morecambe was off."
OL,18,FThe next day he went for a walk.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
