OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens if all the lights go
OL,4,Aout? This is the plan for a 'Black Sky'
OL,5,Aevent
OL,6,
OL,7,F"[It was] almost like a zombie movie,"
OL,8,Fhe said. "People trying to find phone
OL,9,Freception, wondering where things were,
OL,10,Fand there was a huge queue at the one
OL,11,Fworking telephone box."
